If $z^8 - z^6 + z^4 - z^2 + 1 = 0,$ then
\[(z^2 + 1)(z^8 - z^6 + z^4 - z^2 + 1) = z^{10} + 1 = 0.\]So $z^{10} = -1 = \operatorname{cis} 180^\circ,$ which means
